[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_pll8n")
dialogue_id = "debate_theocracy"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Utmost Spirituality"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: My explorer friend recently visited a shard that functions like one giant monastery.
historian: It is a society perfectly united by faith.
historian: The people there never argue and live in absolute peace.
historian: But they achieve this by treating the physical world as a meaningless distraction.
historian: When their crops fail, they endure the hunger, convinced that their suffering is a sign of spiritual purity.
historian: They have achieved perfect harmony by completely giving up their own agency.
historian: This is the danger of blind faith in a divine will.
historian: If we believe that our misfortunes are part of a divine plan, we risk losing the very drive that kept us alive after the Shattering.
historian: We must preserve our distinct voices, and personally speak up when the grand unified plan does not work for us."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
